sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard/CLI)
    participant IstioGW as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MR as model-registry-service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ISVCCtrl as ISVC Controller
    participant CSI as mr-storage-initializer
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant BFF as UI BFF<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant AsyncJob as async-upload-job
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP
    participant Sigstore as Sigstore<br/>443/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,DB: Flow 1: Model Registration via REST API
        Client->>IstioGW: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>HTTPS · TLS 1.2+ · OAuth2/OIDC
        IstioGW->>MR: Forward request<br/>HTTP · Istio mTLS (ISTIO_MUTUAL)<br/>AuthorizationPolicy enforced
        MR->>DB: INSERT registered_model<br/>MySQL/PG protocol · TLS 1.2+ (optional)<br/>Username/password auth
        DB-->>MR: Result
        MR-->>IstioGW: 201 Created (JSON)
        IstioGW-->>Client: Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over K8sAPI,MR: Flow 2: InferenceService Reconciliation
        K8sAPI->>ISVCCtrl: Watch event: InferenceService created/updated
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET Service (lookup model-registry)<br/>HTTPS · TLS · SA token
        K8sAPI-->>ISVCCtrl: Service details
        ISVCCtrl->>MR: POST/PATCH model metadata<br/>HTTP · TLS 1.2+ (configurable)<br/>Bearer token (K8s SA)
        MR-->>ISVCCtrl: Registration result
        ISVCCtrl->>K8sAPI: PATCH InferenceService (add labels/annotations)<br/>HTTPS · TLS · SA token
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over CSI,S3: Flow 3: Model Download via CSI Storage Initializer
        Note right of CSI: KServe spawns as init container
        CSI->>MR: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/model_versions/{id}/artifacts<br/>HTTP · None/TLS
        MR-->>CSI: Model artifact URI (s3://bucket/model)
        CSI->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS · TLS · Cloud credentials
        S3-->>CSI: Model files
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over AsyncJob,Sigstore: Flow 4: Async Model Upload
        AsyncJob->>HF: Download model<br/>HTTPS · TLS · API key (optional)
        HF-->>AsyncJob: Model files
        AsyncJob->>OCI: Push model as OCI artifact<br/>HTTPS · TLS · Username/password
        OCI-->>AsyncJob: Push result
        AsyncJob->>MR: Register model/version/artifact<br/>REST · TLS · Bearer token
        MR-->>AsyncJob: Registration result
        AsyncJob->>Sigstore: Sign model artifact (optional)<br/>HTTPS · TLS · OIDC identity token
        Sigstore-->>AsyncJob: Signature
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 230)
        Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 5: UI BFF API Proxy
        Browser->>BFF: GET /api/v1/model-registry<br/>HTTP/HTTPS · TLS 1.3 (if configured)<br/>Bearer token
        BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS · TLS · SA/user token
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Access decision
        BFF->>MR: Proxy to model-registry<br/>HTTP · TLS 1.2+ (configurable)<br/>Bearer token passthrough
        MR-->>BFF: API response
        BFF-->>Browser: JSON response
    end
